   D)  is','Escolha a melhor alternativa para a questão reproduzida na imagem.','[{"key": "A", "text": "are"}, {"key": "B", "text": "have been"}, {"key": "C", "text": "are being"}, {"key": "D", "text": "is"}]'::jsonb,'multiple-choice',ARRAY['D']::text[],'Choice D is the best answer. The convention being tested is subject-verb agreement. The singular verb “is credited” agrees in number with the singular subject “mathematician Grigori Perelman.”','/sat-assets/practice-10/rw-m2-q24.png','https://satsuite.collegeboard.org/media/pdf/sat-practice-test-10-digital.pdf',28,'published'),
('practice-10-paper','reading-writing',2,25,'-25 - - -
    Researchers studying magnetosensation have
